{
  "script_id": "enneper-surface",
  "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
  "voice_key": "yunxi",
  "files": [
    {
      "script_id": "enneper-surface",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-1",
      "filename": "intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/enneper-surface/intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.63,
      "size": 58032,
      "text": "极小曲面听起来很高深，但有一张极小曲面的方程简单到出人意料，只用到三次多项式，连三角函数都不需要。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "enneper-surface",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-2",
      "filename": "intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/enneper-surface/intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "duration": 4.45,
      "size": 71136,
      "text": "这就是恩内佩尔曲面，由德国数学家恩内佩尔在一八六四年给出。横坐标是 u 减去 u 的三次方除以三，再加上 u 乘 v 的平方。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "enneper-surface",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-3",
      "filename": "intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/enneper-surface/intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.87,
      "size": 61920,
      "text": "纵坐标把 u 和 v 的角色互换，竖直坐标则是 u 的平方减去 v 的平方。就这么三行，一张极小曲面就诞生了。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "enneper-surface",
      "section_id": "minimal",
      "line_id": "min-1",
      "filename": "minimal-min-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/enneper-surface/minimal-min-1.mp3",
      "duration": 4.38,
      "size": 70128,
      "text": "判断一张曲面是不是极小曲面，只需要看它的平均曲率。如果每一点的平均曲率都等于零，它就是极小曲面，对应肥皂膜的形状。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "enneper-surface",
      "section_id": "minimal",
      "line_id": "min-2",
      "filename": "minimal-min-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/enneper-surface/minimal-min-2.mp3",
      "duration": 4.0,
      "size": 64080,
      "text": "把恩内佩尔曲面的方程代进去算，平均曲率会精确地化为零。你可以在屏幕上看到数值验证的结果，始终贴在零上。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "enneper-surface",
      "section_id": "minimal",
      "line_id": "min-3",
      "filename": "minimal-min-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/enneper-surface/minimal-min-3.mp3",
      "duration": 4.49,
      "size": 71856,
      "text": "它的高斯曲率则是负四除以一加 u 平方加 v 平方的四次方，处处为负。这符合一般规律：极小曲面的高斯曲率不可能为正。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "enneper-surface",
      "section_id": "selfcross",
      "line_id": "cross-1",
      "filename": "selfcross-cross-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/enneper-surface/selfcross-cross-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.69,
      "size": 59040,
      "text": "现在看画面。随着参数范围扩大，曲面长出四片花瓣，像一朵翻卷的花。请注意花瓣之间的位置关系。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "enneper-surface",
      "section_id": "selfcross",
      "line_id": "cross-2",
      "filename": "selfcross-cross-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/enneper-surface/selfcross-cross-2.mp3",
      "duration": 4.09,
      "size": 65520,
      "text": "当参数继续增大，花瓣开始互相穿过对方。曲面自己和自己相交了，这在数学上叫自交，是这张曲面最重要的特征。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "enneper-surface",
      "section_id": "selfcross",
      "line_id": "cross-3",
      "filename": "selfcross-cross-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/enneper-surface/selfcross-cross-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.7,
      "size": 59184,
      "text": "注意自交不等于曲面破了。参数平面上每个点都对应一个光滑的曲面片，只是不同的点被映到了空间中的同一个位置。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "enneper-surface",
      "section_id": "immersion",
      "line_id": "imm-1",
      "filename": "immersion-imm-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/enneper-surface/immersion-imm-1.mp3",
      "duration": 4.28,
      "size": 68400,
      "text": "这就引出一对必须分清的概念。如果映射处处光滑且局部是单射，我们说曲面是浸入的。如果全局也不重叠，才叫嵌入。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "enneper-surface",
      "section_id": "immersion",
      "line_id": "imm-2",
      "filename": "immersion-imm-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/enneper-surface/immersion-imm-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.86,
      "size": 61776,
      "text": "恩内佩尔曲面是浸入但不是嵌入。它的历史地位就在这里：它是第一个说明完备极小曲面未必嵌入的具体例子。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "enneper-surface",
      "section_id": "immersion",
      "line_id": "imm-3",
      "filename": "immersion-imm-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/enneper-surface/immersion-imm-3.mp3",
      "duration": 4.22,
      "size": 67536,
      "text": "用复变函数看它会更漂亮。极小曲面有个叫 Weierstrass 表示的构造法，恩内佩尔曲面对应的两个函数简单到只有一和 w。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "enneper-surface",
      "section_id": "explore",
      "line_id": "exp-1",
      "filename": "explore-exp-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/enneper-surface/explore-exp-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.9,
      "size": 62352,
      "text": "请拖动缩放滑块，从小到大观察这张曲面。参数较小时四片花瓣彼此分开，看起来像一个规规矩矩的鞍面。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "enneper-surface",
      "section_id": "explore",
      "line_id": "exp-2",
      "filename": "explore-exp-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/enneper-surface/explore-exp-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.98,
      "size": 63648,
      "text": "继续放大，花瓣开始靠近、接触，最后穿透。整个过程中平均曲率一直是零，曲面一直是极小曲面。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "enneper-surface",
      "section_id": "explore",
      "line_id": "exp-3",
      "filename": "explore-exp-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/enneper-surface/explore-exp-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.93,
      "size": 62928,
      "text": "也就是说，自交并不影响它作为极小曲面的身份。极小是局部性质，自交是全局现象，两者互不干涉。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "enneper-surface",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-1",
      "filename": "summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/enneper-surface/summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.1,
      "size": 49536,
      "text": "第一，恩内佩尔曲面由三次多项式给出，平均曲率处处为零，高斯曲率处处为负。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "enneper-surface",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-2",
      "filename": "summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/enneper-surface/summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.29,
      "size": 52704,
      "text": "第二，它有四片自交的花瓣，是浸入而不是嵌入。极小是局部性质，自交是全局现象。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "enneper-surface",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-3",
      "filename": "summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/enneper-surface/summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.84,
      "size": 61488,
      "text": "第三，它是极小曲面理论里的经典反例，提醒我们浸入与嵌入必须严格区分。感谢观看，我们下次再见。"
    }
  ],
